# Presmistique Project Structure

Presmistique - AI Resume Builder (https://presmistique.in, API https://api.presmistique.in): a full-stack app with a React frontend and a Node.js/Express backend, designed for both web and mobile clients.

## 🏗️ Project Architecture

### **Core Structure**
- **Frontend**: [resume-builder/](mdc:resume-builder/) - React application with Tailwind CSS
- **Backend**: [backend/](mdc:backend/) - Node.js/Express API server
- **Database**: MongoDB with Mongoose ODM (MongoDB Atlas in production)
- **Deployment**: Cloudflare Pages (frontend); Docker image on GHCR deployed to a VPS behind nginx (backend) — see [docs/DEPLOYMENT.md](mdc:docs/DEPLOYMENT.md)

### **Key Entry Points**
- **Frontend**: [resume-builder/src/App.js](mdc:resume-builder/src/App.js) - Main React application
- **Backend**: [backend/server.js](mdc:backend/server.js) - Express server configuration
- **Backend image**: [backend/Dockerfile](mdc:backend/Dockerfile) - Production image (Node 22 + Debian Chromium)
- **Local Docker**: [docker-compose.yml](mdc:docker-compose.yml) - API + throwaway local MongoDB
- **Production stack**: [deploy/](mdc:deploy/) - `docker-compose.yml` + `deploy.sh` copied to the VPS
- **CI/CD**: [.github/workflows/](mdc:.github/workflows/) - `ci.yml` (PR checks), `deploy-backend.yml` (API deploy)

### **Technology Stack**
- **Frontend**: React 19, Tailwind CSS, React Router, Axios
- **Backend**: Node.js 22, Express, MongoDB, JWT Authentication, Puppeteer + Chromium for PDFs/thumbnails
- **AI Integration**: Google Gemini AI for resume parsing and analysis
- **Payments**: Razorpay integration for subscriptions and token purchases
- **Security**: Helmet, CORS, Rate limiting, XSS protection

### **Key Directories**
- **API Routes**: [backend/routes/](mdc:backend/routes/) - All API endpoints
- **Models**: [backend/models/](mdc:backend/models/) - Database schemas
- **Components**: [resume-builder/src/components/](mdc:resume-builder/src/components/) - React components
- **Templates**: [backend/assets/](mdc:backend/assets/) - Resume templates and styling
- **Scripts**: [backend/scripts/](mdc:backend/scripts/) - Seeding, thumbnail and admin scripts
- **Docs**: [docs/](mdc:docs/) - Project documentation

### **Development Workflow**
1. **Local Development (Docker)**: `docker compose up --build` (API + local MongoDB), then `cd resume-builder && npm start`
2. **Backend Only (Node)**: `cd backend && npm run dev` (needs your own MongoDB)
3. **Frontend Only**: `cd resume-builder && npm start`
4. **Tests**: `cd backend && npm test`; CI runs on every PR and `main` requires "CI passed"

### **Environment Configuration**
- **Backend**: [backend/env.template](mdc:backend/env.template) - Environment variables template (local `backend/.env`; production `/opt/presmistique/api.env` on the VPS)
- **Frontend**: [resume-builder/env.template](mdc:resume-builder/env.template) - `REACT_APP_*` build-time variables (production values in Cloudflare Pages)

### **Documentation Structure**
- **Main Docs**: [docs/PROJECT_DOCUMENTATION.md](mdc:docs/PROJECT_DOCUMENTATION.md) - Central documentation index
- **Deployment**: [docs/DEPLOYMENT.md](mdc:docs/DEPLOYMENT.md) - CI/CD, rollback, server setup
- **Setup**: [docs/BACKEND_SETUP.md](mdc:docs/BACKEND_SETUP.md) - Quick setup guide
- **Templates**: [docs/TEMPLATES_README.md](mdc:docs/TEMPLATES_README.md) - Template system documentation
- **Payments**: [docs/PAYMENTS.md](mdc:docs/PAYMENTS.md) - Razorpay purchases and refunds

### **Branding**
- The only public contact is presmistique@gmail.com (frontend: `resume-builder/src/constants/brand.js`). Never add personal names, emails, phone numbers or GitHub usernames to user-facing code or docs.

### **Mobile Support**
- CORS configured for mobile apps (`capacitor://localhost`, `ionic://localhost`)
- API endpoints designed for mobile consumption
- JWT authentication for mobile sessions
